{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19980","headline":"题韦承总吴王故城下幽居 · 孟郊","name":"题韦承总吴王故城下幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才饱身自贵，巷荒门岂贫。\n韦生堪继相，孟子愿依邻。\n夜思琴语切，昼情茶味新。\n霜枝留过鹊，风竹扫蒙尘。\n郢唱一声发，吴花千片春。\n对君何所得，归去觉情真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}